{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02981","headline":"咏史 · 张九龄","name":"咏史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"大德始无颇，中智是所是。\n居然已不一，况乃务相诡。\n小道致泥难，巧言因萋毁。\n穰侯或见迟，苏生得阴揣。\n轻既长沙傅，重亦边郡徙。\n势倾不幸然，迹在胡宁尔。\n沧溟所爲大，江汉日来委。\n沣水虽复清，鱼鼈岂游此。\n贤哉有小白，雠中有管氏。\n若人不世生，悠悠多如彼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02981.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02981","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}